      "name": "Charity",
      "description": "Also known as \"The Giver's Vessel,\" or \"The Bountiful Chalice.\" Charity, often depicted as a vase in the celestial canvas, is a symbol of generosity and compassion across many cultures. In regions where the art of giving is cherished, it is known as \"The Giver's Vessel,\" a tribute to those who extend their hands to others in need. In some agricultural societies, people call it \"The Bountiful Chalice,\" believing its appearance brings forth plentiful harvests and blessings.",
